    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d309-a13-a1">

                <pb facs="0514" n="444" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg444"/>

                <head>Mr. Cole to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 27, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have just received a telegraphic despatch
                    from Los Angeles, California, in the following terms:</p>
                <p>“Get the department to intercede for Ygnacio Sepulveda, of this place, taken
                    prisoner at Queretaro, Mexico.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">“V, E. HOWARD.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">“P. BANNING.”</p>
                <p>I have personal knowledge of the fact that there is residing at or near Los
                    Angeles, in my State, a very respectable Mexican or Spanish family by the name
                    of Sepulveda, but I am not certain that I know this Ygnacio, who, it seems, is
                    now a prisoner in Mexico.</p>
                <p>Mr. Howard, ex-member of Congress, and Mr. Banning, State senator, are gentlemen
                    of <pb facs="0515" n="445" xml:id="pg445"/> the highest respectability; and I
                    hope their natural solicitude, as well as that of the Sepulvedas, may be
                    gratified by a speedy application on behalf of Ygnacio to the Mexican
                    government.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. COLE, <hi rendition="#italic">United States Senator for
                            California.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
